stream
BT /F1 9 Tf 40 750 Td 11 TL
(ARENA LADDER PAYOUT & UNCERTAINTY COST POLICY - 2026 SEASON 2) Tj T*
(Competitive Integrity & Settlement Working Group) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. SCOPE) Tj T*
(This memo fixes the payout and uncertainty constants used by the quarterly) Tj T*
(weighted arena-ladder settlement. Values here are authoritative and are) Tj T*
(deliberately NOT duplicated in any plaintext file in the export set.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. MANUAL-REVIEW COST) Tj T*
(Each match flagged by the calibrated smurf detector \(yhat = 1\) incurs a) Tj T*
(manual review. The inspection unit cost is 1613 credits per) Tj T*
(flagged match. It is charged per flagged match and weighted by the rarity) Tj T*
(weight before summation within a stratum.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3. F-BETA) Tj T*
(The headline stratified quality metric uses F-beta with beta = 2.5,) Tj T*
(reflecting that a missed genuine clear \(recall failure\) is valued more than) Tj T*
(a false ban \(precision failure\). Compute F-beta from the OVERALL weighted) Tj T*
(precision and recall \(ratio of weighted totals\), never by averaging) Tj T*
(per-stratum F-beta for the overall line.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4. NET SETTLEMENT) Tj T*
(Net settlement per stratum = rewarded_credits - review_cost_credits, before) Tj T*
(the smurf levy and settlement floor described in the levy addendum.) Tj T*
(Rewarded credits count only true positives \(y = 1 and yhat = 1\) times the) Tj T*
(per-stratum recovery factor; forfeited credits count only false negatives) Tj T*
(\(y = 1 and yhat = 0\).) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5. CONFIDENCE INTERVALS) Tj T*
(Report 95% Wilson score intervals on the Kish effective sample size) Tj T*
(n_eff = \(sum w\)^2 / sum\(w^2\), computed over the relevant weighted) Tj T*
(denominator subset \(actual positives for recall, predicted positives for) Tj T*
(precision\), with z = 1.959964.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(6. TABLE - PER-LANE REVIEW STAFFING \(reference only, not graded\)) Tj T*
(lane      reviewers   shift_hours   escalation_bps) Tj T*
